Note that the auto-mute feature isn't implemented yet in HG version,
too.  But the mic boost should work at least.

The below is the untested patch for adding the auto-mute feature.
A new model laptop-automute is implemented.  Of course, it's against
the latest HG version.  Give it a try.


Takashi

